KUBERNETES CLUSTER VALIDATOR

Provider-neutral, read-only readiness gate.
Modes: one-time | post-upgrade
Exit 0 = ready, 1 = not-ready, 2 = usage/configuration error.
Report contract: cluster-validator.telekom.com/v1alpha1.
Checks: API/discovery, nodes, namespaces, and active pods.
No remediation is performed. See docs/cluster-validator.md for RBAC,
extensions, signing, SBOM verification, and the post-upgrade runbook.
